        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-53900-54511"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53903-53924"><rb>三世</rb><rt>さんぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53924-53927">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53927-53957"><rb>一娑婆</rb><rt>ひとしやば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53957-53960">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53960-53984"><rb>因果</rb><rt>いんぐわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53984-53987">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53987-54011"><rb>約束</rb><rt>やくそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54011-54014">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54014-54032"><rb>繋</rb><rt>つなが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54032-54056">つたと、いづれも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54056-54092"><rb>發起仕</rb><rt>ほつきつかまつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54092-54098">り、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54098-54119"><rb>懺悔</rb><rt>ざんげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54119-54134">をいたし、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54134-54155"><rb>五欲</rb><rt>ごよく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54155-54158">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54158-54173"><rb>離</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54173-54182">れて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54182-54197"><rb>唯</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54197-54212"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54212-54221">では、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54221-54236"><rb>其</rb><rt>それ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54236-54242">なる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54242-54263"><rb>盲人</rb><rt>めくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54263-54284">ともろともに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54284-54308"><rb>三人</rb><rt>さんにん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54308-54332"><rb>一所</rb><rt>いつしよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54332-54338">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54338-54353"><rb>杖</rb><rt>つゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54353-54356">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54356-54377"><rb>引連</rb><rt>ひきつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54377-54386">れて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54386-54401"><rb>晝</rb><rt>ひる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54401-54404">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54404-54422"><rb>面</rb><rt>おもて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54422-54425">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54425-54440"><rb>恥</rb><rt>はづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54440-54452">かしい、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54452-54467"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54467-54479">とあれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54479-54494"><rb>通</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54494-54511">ります……</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-54511-54576"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54514-54529"><rb>路</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54529-54538">すがら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54538-54559"><rb>行逢</rb><rt>ゆきあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54559-54576">ひました。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-54576-55001"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54579-54609"><rb>御迷惑</rb><rt>ごめいわく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54609-54612">か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54612-54627"><rb>存</rb><rt>ぞん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54627-54639">ぜぬが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54639-54654"><rb>靄</rb><rt>もや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54654-54657">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54657-54672"><rb>袖</rb><rt>そで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54672-54675">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54675-54696"><rb>擦合</rb><rt>すれあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54696-54702">うた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54702-54723"><rb>御縁</rb><rt>ごえん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54723-54744">とて、ぴつたり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54744-54759"><rb>胸</rb><rt>むね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54759-54762">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54762-54777"><rb>當</rb><rt>あた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54777-54780">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54780-54795"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54795-54828">がありましたにより、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54828-54852"><rb>心着</rb><rt>こゝろづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54852-54855">け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54855-54879"><rb>申上</rb><rt>まをしあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54879-54897">げます……お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54897-54918"><rb>聞入</rb><rt>きゝい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54918-54927">れ、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54927-54948"><rb>取棄</rb><rt>とりす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54948-54963">て、ともお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54963-54996"><rb>心次第</rb><rt>こゝろしだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54996-55001">。</seg></p>
