        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-55467-55712"><seg source="#source-55467-55476">とぼ</seg><choice source="#source-55476-55482"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-55482-55491">とした</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55491-55521"><rb>後姿</rb><rt>うしろすがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55521-55527">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55527-55554"><rb>長頭</rb><rt>ながあたま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55554-55560">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55560-55575"><rb>三</rb><rt>みつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55575-55581">つの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55581-55599"><rb>姿</rb><rt>すがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55599-55602">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55602-55614"><rb>消</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55614-55623">えたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55623-55641"><rb>瓦斯</rb><rt>がす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55641-55647">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55647-55668"><rb>幻</rb><rt>まぼろし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55668-55674">や、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55674-55689"><rb>杖</rb><rt>つゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55689-55692">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55692-55707"><rb>影</rb><rt>かげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55707-55712">。</seg></p>
